title: workspace:save
tags: [[GUI command]] Workspaces
kind: reference
summary: Save this workspace's layout, or its work too, in its repository

`workspace:save <layout|work> <name>` saves the workspace the command runs in under
that name, in its repository: a `layout` holds its panels and how they show things, a
`work` holds what they show too. The name is asked with the names already saved as
completions; one that exists is replaced only once confirmed. What each panel saves is
its own declaration. See [[Saved workspaces]].
